{"2609910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "挂机工厂 AFK Industarry", "steam_appid": 2609910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索一个奇妙的星球，发掘各样的材料，建造各式的建筑，建立自己的家园！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >攀升科技，登上自己研发的火箭</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们的终极目标是把浆果丛种满整个宇宙！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《挂机工厂》是一款像素风流水线建设游戏，在游戏中你将扮演一位坠机到蓝星的工程师，通过自己勤劳的双手，从原始时代开始，建立新的文明。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>虽然是流水线游戏，但是《挂机工厂》。</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当你修好自己的火箭后，就可以前往其他星系探索，在广袤银河中的每一个星球留下你的工厂吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏特色 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从原始时代到宇宙时代，体量虽小但很耐玩，至少10小时+的游戏体验</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >支持离线运行, 即使关闭了游戏, 工厂仍然在运转, 宇宙也在变化</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5种不同地貌的星球：海洋/冰霜/熔岩/干旱/类地</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >唯一的任务就是修理火箭，这是个和平的世界，打开一首音乐，你可以尽情慢慢享受建造流水线的时光</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >重要Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >锤子快捷键：Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >磁吸快捷键：E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >注意：<u>只有同时将资源吸入建筑的时候，建筑才会运作</u></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索一个奇妙的星球，发掘各样的材料，建造各式的建筑，建立自己的家园！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >攀升科技，登上自己研发的火箭</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们的终极目标是把浆果丛种满整个宇宙！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《挂机工厂》是一款像素风流水线建设游戏，在游戏中你将扮演一位坠机到蓝星的工程师，通过自己勤劳的双手，从原始时代开始，建立新的文明。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>虽然是流水线游戏，但是《挂机工厂》。</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当你修好自己的火箭后，就可以前往其他星系探索，在广袤银河中的每一个星球留下你的工厂吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏特色 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从原始时代到宇宙时代，体量虽小但很耐玩，至少10小时+的游戏体验</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >支持离线运行, 即使关闭了游戏, 工厂仍然在运转, 宇宙也在变化</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5种不同地貌的星球：海洋/冰霜/熔岩/干旱/类地</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >唯一的任务就是修理火箭，这是个和平的世界，打开一首音乐，你可以尽情慢慢享受建造流水线的时光</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >重要Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >锤子快捷键：Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >磁吸快捷键：E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >注意：<u>只有同时将资源吸入建筑的时候，建筑才会运作</u></p>", "short_description": "从钻木取火，到飞向银河！《挂机工厂》是一款麻雀虽小，五脏俱全的流水线建设游戏。种田→畜牧→冶金→工业革命→开辟航线→电子芯片→改造星球→探索宇宙，用你的双手创造这一切！", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609910/header.jpg?t=1752745749", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609910/77eec40cd56a76e2d475aa11526890326fda8647/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752745749", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609910/77eec40cd56a76e2d475aa11526890326fda8647/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752745749", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 以上<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz 以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 支持DirectX9或以上的显卡<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["weathering"], "publishers": ["weathering"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609910/ss_2caf5dd3a48797c95656cc3c6660dc087cf5b523.600x338.jpg?t=1752745749", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609910/ss_2caf5dd3a48797c95656cc3c6660dc087cf5b523.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752745749"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_